    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "Reminder: The Check Swing Challenge threshold in the Minors has been much higher than you’d think.",
      "likes": 52,
      "reposts": 11,
      "replies": 5,
      "at": "2026-10-25T04:11:44.546Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myodoori7s2f",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Parallel to the baselines is definitely a lot further than the conventional wisdom on what a \"swing\" is.",
          "likes": 6,
          "author": "proggyboog.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I think that seems too far. \nBUT...\nIt's definitive and objective, and much better than the MLB version, which based on...  vibes?",
          "likes": 3,
          "author": "comish4lif.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Interesting how much that looked just like Diaz’s swing",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "truxmintinbox.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Big fan of how simple that is as a judgment line. \n\nIm so in favor of this it makes so much sense",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "codyvidmar.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "参考までに：マイナーリーグでのチェックスイング・チャレンジの判定基準は、思われているよりずっと高い。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The Brewers are in St. Pete with a two games to none lead in the World Series, and their favorite Robin flew along. “Hey, I waited 44 years for this!” Hall of Famer Robin Yount said. “I am not missing a game.” www.mlb.com/news/brewers...",
      "likes": 43,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-10-26T00:05:20.082Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3myqgeyo64k22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ブルワーズはワールドシリーズで2連勝し、セントピーターズバーグへ。お気に入りのRobinも同行した。「44年待ったんだ！1試合も逃したくない」と殿堂入りのロビン・ヨーントは語った。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "Side angle. Close, and probably depends on which fanbase is viewing",
      "likes": 24,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 10,
      "at": "2026-10-25T03:56:14.865Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3myocsy5tnc27",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "I don't think this counts as that close.",
          "likes": 13,
          "author": "walkingtaako.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "For what it’s worth (absolutely nothing), I think he offered",
          "likes": 10,
          "author": "afkostka.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I think MLB would benefit by defining a physical threshold on a swing versus its extremely vague “struck at” language.",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "jr-fellow.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Close?",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "slick-durango.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "横からのアングル。際どい。どちらのファンから見るかで印象が変わりそう"
    },
    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "Aaron Ashby this postseason: 8 G, 15 2/3 IP, 5 H, 0 R, 3 BB, 17 K He's converted all three of his save opportunities, each of which have been at least 1 2/3 innings long.",
      "likes": 23,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-10-25T03:50:41.067Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myocizt42k2g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "今ポストシーズンのアーロン・アシュビー：8試合、15回2/3、被安打5、失点0、四球3、奪三振17。セーブ機会3度すべてを成功させ、いずれも1回2/3以上を投げ切っている。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "“You going to let $1 million stand in the way of signing a Hall of Famer?\" One of of my favorite tales of the '26 Brewers, from Bob Nightengale early in the season. Did Brice Turang really say it? We got to witness him and Matt Arnold hash it out. www.mlb.com/brewers/news...",
      "likes": 18,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-10-25T21:35:25.260Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3myq5ywjzac2u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "「100万ドルのせいで殿堂入り選手との契約を見送るのか？」シーズン序盤にボブ・ナイトンゲールが伝えた、'26ブルワーズ屈指のお気に入りエピソード。ブライス・トゥーラングは本当にそう言ったのか？本人とマット・アーノルドのやり取りを目の当たりにした。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "The Astros are hiring Conner Watson as their new director of hitting, source tells @theathletic.com. Watson, a former Driveline employee, worked as the Cleveland Guardians assistant director of hitting development for the past two years.",
      "likes": 14,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-10-25T20:40:48.845Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hqnn3kfpfuhkhv2b4izkrzpa/app.bsky.feed.post/3myq2xbvqacyk",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Who is actually hiring these \"coaches.\" The AGMs would be my guess.",
          "likes": 7,
          "author": "orangefire.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Driveline background signals data-driven approach. The Guardians development pipeline is producing results that other organizations clearly want to replicate.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "coachchron.com"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "アストロズが新しい打撃ディレクターにコナー・ワトソンを迎える、と@theathletic.comが関係者の話として報じた。元Drivelineの職員で、過去2年はガーディアンズで打撃育成のアシスタントディレクターを務めた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "Like Spencer Medick's role as director of pitching, this is not a uniformed position on the major-league staff. Watson and Medick will oversee the entire organizational philosophy and infrastructure of their respective areas.",
      "likes": 11,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-10-25T20:51:13.420Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hqnn3kfpfuhkhv2b4izkrzpa/app.bsky.feed.post/3myq3jvkar2yk",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "投手ディレクターのスペンサー・メディックと同じく、メジャーのユニフォーム組のコーチではない。ワトソンとメディックが、それぞれの分野で組織全体の方針と土台づくりを統括する。"
    },
